# 🚀 Project Management System

A full-stack web application designed to simplify project planning, task management, team collaboration, and workflow tracking within organizations and academic environments.

The system provides a centralized platform where users can create projects, assign tasks, manage teams, monitor progress, and receive automated notifications.

---

## 📌 Overview

The **Project Management System** enables teams to efficiently manage projects from initiation to completion. It offers secure authentication, workspace management, task tracking, automated notifications, and analytics dashboards to improve productivity and collaboration.

Built using the **PERN Stack (PostgreSQL, Express.js, React.js, Node.js)** along with modern cloud technologies for scalability and performance.

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Frontend

* React.js
* Vite
* Tailwind CSS
* JavaScript (ES6+)

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js

### Database

* PostgreSQL
* Neon Database

### Authentication & Background Services

* Clerk Authentication
* Inngest Background Jobs

### Development Tools

* Visual Studio Code
* Git & GitHub
* Postman
* Prisma ORM

### Deployment

* Vercel (Frontend)
* Render (Backend)
* Neon PostgreSQL (Database)

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

The application follows a **3-Tier Architecture**:

### 1. Presentation Layer

* User Interface
* React.js Frontend
* Responsive Design using Tailwind CSS

### 2. Application Layer

* Business Logic
* REST APIs using Express.js
* Authentication & Authorization

### 3. Data Layer

* PostgreSQL Database
* Prisma ORM
* Data Storage & Retrieval

---

## ✨ Features

### 🔐 Secure Authentication

* User Registration & Login
* Clerk Authentication Integration
* Session Management
* Role-Based Access Control

### 🏢 Workspace Management

* Create Multiple Organizations
* Workspace-Based Collaboration
* Team Management

### 📁 Project Management

* Create Projects
* Edit & Delete Projects
* Set Project Priorities
* Track Progress
* Manage Deadlines

### ✅ Task Management

* Create Tasks
* Assign Tasks to Team Members
* Update Task Status
* Monitor Task Lifecycle
* Deadline Tracking

### 👥 Team Collaboration

* Invite Members via Email
* Role Assignment
* Workspace-Based Collaboration

### 🔔 Automated Notifications

* Task Assignment Alerts
* Deadline Reminders
* Background Job Processing using Inngest

### 📊 Dashboard & Analytics

* Project Statistics
* Task Overview
* Progress Monitoring
* Overdue Task Tracking

### 🗄️ Database Management

* Relational Database Design
* User, Workspace, Project & Task Modules
* Prisma ORM Integration

### ☁️ Cloud Deployment

* Frontend Hosted on Vercel
* Backend Hosted on Render
* PostgreSQL Database Hosted on Neon

